      <description><![CDATA[
        India&#39;s private space sector just cleared a massive hurdle. Agnikul Cosmos successfully test-fired a cluster of four semi-cryogenic engines simultaneously, redefining the country&#39;s responsive launch calculus.
        
        [SPLIT]
        ⚡ The breakthrough validates the core architecture of the Agnibaan launch vehicle for responsive deployment.
        [SPLIT]
        ⚡ Heavy reliance on 3D-printing and domestic manufacturing underscores the maturation of the Atmanirbhar Bharat defense and space industrial base.
        [SPLIT]
